  \"S-storage\",\n        \"S-storage-messages\",\n        \"S-votes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"connection\": {\n      \"explanation\": \"Term/role and installed configuration determine which support the leader consumes. Reset discards vote tallies, remote Match estimates and acknowledged read queue but preserves log/commit history; new leaders append a current-term no-op, and log freshness carries committed history through elections. Old-term append support is ignored. Old storage completions cannot stabilize overwritten entries, while snapshot/application completions concern already decided history and remain meaningful across terms. Restoration reconstructs history and configuration before eligibility. Pending pre-commit reads are a distinct queue whose lifetime needs investigation. Membership updates may recompute commit, whereas application completion can propose automatic joint exit; these follow-up effects are not interchangeable.\",\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n        \"B-authority\",\n        \"B-form\",\n        \"B-config\",\n        \"B-apply\",\n        \"B-recover\",\n        \"B-read\",\n        \"B-persist\"\n      ],\n      \"fact_ids\": [\n        \"F-committed\",\n        \"F-config\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"S-advance\",\n        \"S-api\",\n        \"S-apply\",\n        \"S-async\",\n        \"S-autoleave\",\n        \"S-changer\",\n        \"S-commit\",\n        \"S-config\",\n        \"S-confrestore\",\n        \"S-election\",\n        \"S-log\",\n        \"S-logprogress\",\n        \"S-proposal\",\n        \"S-quorum\",\n        \"S-read\",\n        \"S-readqueue\",\n        \"S-ready\",\n        \"S-recovery\",\n        \"S-release\",\n        \"S-reset\",\n        \"S-response\",\n        \"S-roles\",\n        \"S-send\",\n        \"S-start\",\n        \"S-step\",\n        \"S-storage\",\n        \"S-storage-messages\",\n        \"S-tracker\",\n        \"S-votes\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"open_details\": [\n      \"Automatic joint-exit retry after transfer rejection and timeout.\",\n      \"Legal reachability of first current-term commitment through configuration application with pending reads.\",\n      \"Pre-commit read queue lifetime across authority changes.\",\n      \"Detailed snapshot/flow-control retries, storage implementation mutation boundaries and client cancellation paths remain open.\"\n    ],\n    \"core_gaps\": [],\n    \"status\": \"usable\",\n    \"rationale\": \"Representative formation, authority transitions, their connection and necessary support paths have been read. Remaining local continuations and deeper variants are explicit; no experimental finding is claimed.\"\n  },\n  \"understanding_changes\": [\n    {\n      \"operation_id\": \"53e89bf38f61443f98ceafdf11251ba2\",\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"53e89bf38f61443f98ceafdf11251ba2\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_objective\": {\n    \"action\": \"investigate_and_refocus\",\n    \"boundary\": \"both_core_paths\",\n    \"reason\": \"Use results to update understanding and compare the remaining frontier\",\n    \"core_gaps\": []\n  },\n  \"drafts\": [],\n  \"candidates\": [],\n  \"units\": [],\n  \"claims\": [],\n  \"artifacts\": [],\n  \"assessments\": [],\n  \"frontier\": {\n    \"relationships\": [\n      {\n        \"fact_id\": \"F-committed\",\n        \"source_ids\": [\n          \"S-log\",\n          \"S-commit\",\n          \"S-reset\",\n          \"S-start\",\n          \"S-apply\",\n          \"S-async\"\n        ],\n        \"unknowns\": [],\n        \"producers\": [\n          \"B-form\",\n          \"B-follow\",\n          \"B-config\",\n          \"B-recover\"\n        ],\n        \"consumers\": [\n          \"B-authority\",\n          \"B-config\",\n          \"B-apply\",\n          \"B-read\"\n        ],\n        \"invalidators\": [],\n      